<title>UK: World Bank sets 20 billion drachma bond due 2001.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 20 billion drachma bond due 2001.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Chase Manhattan, National Bank of Greece and National Mortgaged Bank of Greece.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN GRD    COUPON     10.25     MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE    30.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  10 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING  LUX/ATHENS  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/GR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  5 BP	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
